{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-01-tansley-parcel-site/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:10:55.661Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"0dd7c26966da39fb41a6c52d349734ef6e2f64acf89e1824f742966570639068","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#inc-tansley-carrier-api","text":"@Tobias Rendle It was Southgate. In Pree's incident posts from 3 Sep 2025, label printing stalled at the Tansley Parcel depots and Southgate dispatch had totes stacked beside door 4. Southgate was also the site that cleared the backlog once the incident was resolved. Neither the channel nor the files I can see give a city or address for Southgate, so for that, Pree or the account record would be the place to check.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791987000.000127","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"}}
{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-01-tansley-parcel-site/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:10:59.350Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"183a40d823f716e5a91eb6638a4b80d7264bc092f7704ffff942e8367d255404","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","text":"I answered Tobias in a thread on their message in #inc-tansley-carrier-api: the depot was **Southgate**.\n\n- **Source:** This comes from the incident channel, which Tobias is a member of. On 3 Sep 2025 Pree posted that label printing had stalled at the Tansley Parcel depots and that \"Southgate dispatch has totes stacked beside door 4.\" The closing post says Southgate cleared the backlog once the outage was fixed.\n- **Missing detail:** I couldn't find a city or street address for Southgate. The channel doesn't give one, and the account files folder showed nothing I can read. I told Tobias that and suggested asking Pree or checking the account record."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791987000.000128"}}
